<link href="{{ 'mag-component-accordion.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<link href="{{ 'collapsible-content.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<link href="{{ 'component-rte.css' | asset_url }}" rel="stylesheet" type="text/css" media="all" />
<style data-shopify>.section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
    padding-top: 27px;
    padding-bottom: 27px;
  }

  @media screen and (min-width: 750px) {
    .section-{{ section.id }}-padding {
      padding-top: 36px;
      padding-bottom: 36px;
    }
  }</style><div class="color-background-1 gradient">
  <div class="collapsible-content collapsible-none-layout isolate content-container content-container--full-width">
    <div class="collapsible-content__wrapper section-{{ section.id }}-padding">
      <div class="collapsible-content-wrapper-narrow">
        <div class="collapsible-content__header" style="text-align: center;"><p class="caption-with-letter-spacing">FAQs</p>
          
<h2 class="collapsible-content__heading h2">
              You have questions, we have answers
            </h2>
        </div>
        <div class="grid grid--1-col grid--2-col-tablet collapsible-content__grid collapsible-content__grid--reverse">
          <div class="grid__item"><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_PV4jjn-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_PV4jjn-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      What is Magnesium Complex for Women?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_PV4jjn-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_PV4jjn-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>Magnesium Complex for Women is a <strong>20-in-1 daily wellness formula</strong> made with 10 forms of magnesium, Vitamin D3, K2, methylated B vitamins, ashwagandha, myo-inositol, biotin, folate, raspberry ketones, and more to help support overall women’s wellness.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_Ebz7UN-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_Ebz7UN-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      What are the benefits?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_Ebz7UN-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_Ebz7UN-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>This formula is designed to support <strong>relaxation, muscle function, nerve function, daily energy, stress balance, and overall wellness</strong> as part of a consistent daily routine.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_prFPGn-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_prFPGn-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      How many capsules do I take per day?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_prFPGn-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_prFPGn-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>Take <strong>2 capsules daily</strong>, preferably with meals, or as directed by your healthcare professional.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_8qwWKU-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_8qwWKU-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      How long does one bottle last?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_8qwWKU-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_8qwWKU-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>Each bottle includes <strong>240 vegetarian capsules</strong>, which is a <strong>4-month supply</strong> when taking the suggested serving of 2 capsules per day.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_q4yXqi-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_q4yXqi-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      What forms of magnesium are included?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_q4yXqi-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_q4yXqi-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>This formula includes 10 forms of magnesium: Magnesium Glycinate, Citrate, Oxide, Malate, Taurate, Carbonate, Orotate, Aspartate, Lactate, and Ascorbate.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_yakRBi-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_yakRBi-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      Is this only for women?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_yakRBi-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_yakRBi-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>The formula is designed with women’s wellness in mind, including ingredients like <strong>folate, biotin, myo-inositol, D3, K2, B vitamins, and ashwagandha</strong>, but anyone should check with a healthcare professional to see if it fits their routine.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_Y6PWPh-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_Y6PWPh-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      Is it non-GMO?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_Y6PWPh-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_Y6PWPh-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>Yes, this formula is made with non-GMO ingredients.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div><div
                class="accordion"
                
              >
                <details
                  id="Details-collapsible_row_nK986E-{{ section.id }}"
                  
                >
                  <summary id="Summary-collapsible_row_nK986E-{{ section.id }}">
                    
                    <h3 class="accordion__title h4">
                      Can I take this with other supplements?
                    </h3>
                    <svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" class="icon icon-caret" viewBox="0 0 10 6">
  <path fill-rule="evenodd" clip-rule="evenodd" d="M9.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708 0L5 4.293 1.354.646a.5.5 0 00-.708.708l4 4a.5.5 0 00.708 0l4-4a.5.5 0 000-.708z" fill="currentColor">
</svg>

                  </summary>
                  <div
                    class="accordion__content rte"
                    id="CollapsibleAccordion-collapsible_row_nK986E-{{ section.id }}"
                    role="region"
                    aria-labelledby="Summary-collapsible_row_nK986E-{{ section.id }}"
                  >
                    <p>You can, but because this formula already includes magnesium, D3, K2, B vitamins, biotin, folate, and more, it’s best to check your current supplement routine to avoid taking too much of the same nutrients.</p>
                    
                  </div>
                </details>
              </div></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Magnesium collapsible",
  "class": "section",
  "settings": []
}
{% endschema %}
